t color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，则额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，若目标属于&lt;骑士同盟&gt;或&lt;漂泊者&gt;，再额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量；之后自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"舍身守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">舍身守护</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0 5.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/d1ti1m0mflt9zupa29zhgu9xs5y50rm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"84\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/d1ti1m0mflt9zupa29zhgu9xs5y50rm.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0_5.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ea/d1ti1m0mflt9zupa29zhgu9xs5y50rm.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"168\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/克拉拉\"><img alt=\"头像 克拉拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/he10i3yxupczk82a0dnmgnkcfe0rtzn.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">克拉拉</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"displ